<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</link><description>由于土耳其央行准备金大幅下降，交易商正在撤回对土耳其 12 月降息的押注，这引发了人们对政策制定者支持里拉的难度可能加大的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink'&gt;由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey’s Traders See Slower Rate Cut Pace as Reserves Shrink&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:12:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据说蒂姆霍顿中国正在权衡包括出售股权在内的选择</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/tim-hortons-china-is-said-to-weigh-options-including-stake-sale</link><description>据知情人士透露，在大中华区经营 Tim Hortons 咖啡店的 TH International Ltd. 正在探索可能导致股权出售的方案。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/tim-hortons-china-is-said-to-weigh-options-including-stake-sale'&gt;据说蒂姆霍顿中国正在权衡包括出售股权在内的选择&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tim Hortons China Is Said to Weigh Options Including Stake Sale&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/tim-hortons-china-is-said-to-weigh-options-including-stake-sale</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:19:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国关税计划增加了印度达成贸易协议的赌注</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/us-tariffs-raise-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal-video</link><description>美国计划对印度商品征收 17% 的关税，低于越南、马来西亚和孟加拉国等地区同行。根据美国贸易代表的一份声明，如果该国未能达成协议，税率将提高至 25%。这给印度带来了压力，要求其同意贸易协议，否则将面临更高的征税，导致出口商和投资者对贸易前景不太清楚。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/us-tariffs-raise-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal-video'&gt;美国关税计划增加了印度达成贸易协议的赌注&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Tariff Plan Raises Stakes for India to Clinch Trade Deal&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/us-tariffs-raise-stakes-for-india-to-clinch-trade-deal-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:28:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>胡塞武装袭击红海两个沙特港口，油价上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/oil-rises-as-houthis-attack-two-saudi-ports-on-red-sea-video</link><description>由于伊朗支持的胡塞叛军继续瞄准沙特阿拉伯，包括拉斯坦努拉的炼油厂以及红海港口吉达和吉赞，油价扩大涨幅。与此同时，阿拉伯联合酋长国表示，由于战争暴露了波斯湾的脆弱性，该国计划在霍尔木兹海峡以外的东海岸扩大电力和海水淡化项目。斯图尔特·利文斯通-华莱士报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/oil-rises-as-houthis-attack-two-saudi-ports-on-red-sea-video'&gt;胡塞武装袭击红海两个沙特港口，油价上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Oil Rises as Houthis Attack Two Saudi Ports on Red Sea&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/oil-rises-as-houthis-attack-two-saudi-ports-on-red-sea-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:31:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度 11 月股市流入达 147 亿美元，卢比创 8 个月新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/rupee-hits-8-month-high-as-india-november-stock-inflows-reach-14-7-billion</link><description>澳新银行集团认为卢比兑美元还有进一步升值至 90-91 卢比的空间。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/rupee-hits-8-month-high-as-india-november-stock-inflows-reach-14-7-billion'&gt;印度 11 月股市流入达 147 亿美元，卢比创 8 个月新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rupee Hits 8-Month High as India November Stock Inflows Reach $14.7 Billion: INR&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/rupee-hits-8-month-high-as-india-november-stock-inflows-reach-14-7-billion</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:32:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>